cpanfile:3 requires LWP 6.04, but not LWP::Protocol::https. WWW::Chain::UA::LWP (lib/WWW/Chain/UA/LWP.pm:21) fetches any user url, and ex/synopsis.pl:20 uses https://conflict.industries/.

Failure case: a fresh installation with a chain over an https target gets the answer "Protocol scheme 'https' is not supported" (HTTP 501) from LWP. The chain collects 501 responses instead of data and runs on.

Decide: the cpanfile declares LWP::Protocol::https.

